# Rhythmic demo: "dong-tiki dong-tiki dong tiki ritititi"
# Beats 1 and 2: dong (eighth) + ti ki (sixteenths); beat 3: dong, tiki;
# beat 4: ri ti ti ti (sixteenths, "r" = a quick tongue flap).
title:      Dong-tiki ritititi
instrument: Arusha
tempo:      92
meter:      4/4

[rhythm]
| !dong-tiki dong-tiki dong:1/8 tiki:1/8 ritititi |
